['-p', 'Use the `omg-probe-standalone-html` skill and follow its procedure exactly, then render the note below into `design.html` — a standalone single-file HTML page — in the current working directory.\n\n# Job runner scheduling\n\nA small local job runner executes short-lived jobs submitted from a CLI. Jobs are\nIO-bound, arrive in bursts, and must not outlive the process that started them.\nDecision: a worker pool, bounded to NCPU-2 workers.\n', '--output-format', 'json', '--permission-mode', 'dontAsk', '--session-id', '1670de30-021b-41d6-9abd-17dd3683ca2d']
